  "title": "Apple’s Lease-to-Own Program Launches",
  "summary": "Apple has announced a new lease-to-own program for iPhones, iPads, and Macs, which includes both leasing and purchasing options with the aim of addressing component and RAM shortages. This program reflects Apple’s broader strategy to compete with other tech giants in the market.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Apple launched a lease-to-own program for iPhones, iPads, and Macs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The program includes options to upgrade to a new device early or return the device at the end of the lease.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The program is designed to address component and RAM shortages, which have driven up prices.",
